{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 18272795771267692287,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Hello, world ... what's next ?",
      "source_hash": 7571011962485265246,
      "context_hash": 1396069260171514955,
      "translation": "Hello, world ... 다음은 무엇일까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118421Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "OK, you are happy, you designed a RISC-V core, ran it in Verilator, synthetized it and sent it to the device, and it seems to do something.",
      "source_hash": 17490221584749259856,
      "context_hash": 17354943727450050090,
      "translation": "좋습니다, 여러분은 만족스러운 상태입니다. RISC-V 코어를 설계하고, Verilator에서 실행해 보고, 합성한 뒤 장치로 전송했으며, 무언가 동작하는 것처럼 보입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118422Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Well, what could we do with it now ?",
      "source_hash": 16025825165381487126,
      "context_hash": 13212965195127169401,
      "translation": "자, 이제 이것으로 무엇을 할 수 있을까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118422Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Tinyraytracer",
      "source_hash": 497284049373942849,
      "context_hash": 11742570685582182618,
      "translation": "Tinyraytracer",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118422Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "My friend Dmitry Sokolov wrote a nice self-contained raytracing program called [Tinyraytracer](https://github.com/ssloy/tinyraytracer) for his computer graphics course.",
      "source_hash": 15363488918011460528,
      "context_hash": 5557562476912340632,
      "translation": "제 친구 Dmitry Sokolov는 자신의 컴퓨터 그래픽스 강의를 위해 [Tinyraytracer](https://github.com/ssloy/tinyraytracer)라는 훌륭한 독립형 레이트레이싱 프로그램을 작성했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118422Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It is an interesting program to be run on your own risc-v core, because:",
      "source_hash": 2780851060019450878,
      "context_hash": 13439650106395851523,
      "translation": "이 프로그램은 여러분 자신의 risc-v 코어에서 실행해 보기에 흥미로운 프로그램인데, 그 이유는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118422Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "it generates nice images",
      "source_hash": 18178527240650170554,
      "context_hash": 12612836796423227169,
      "translation": "멋진 이미지를 생성합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118423Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "it tests many functionalities of your core (a good testbench)",
      "source_hash": 17477266680830102049,
      "context_hash": 14788927730363295357,
      "translation": "여러분 코어의 다양한 기능을 테스트합니다 (훌륭한 테스트벤치입니다)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118423Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "it can be compiled with different instruction sets, from the bare RV32I used by the tiny femtorv32-quark to the full-fledged RV32IMFC femtorv32-petitbateau (with hardware that floats).",
      "source_hash": 16990882975111460589,
      "context_hash": 5283618791957073933,
      "translation": "아주 작은 femtorv32-quark가 사용하는 최소한의 RV32I부터, 완전한 기능을 갖춘 (부동소수점 하드웨어가 있는) femtorv32-petitbateau의 RV32IMFC에 이르기까지, 다양한 명령어 집합으로 컴파일할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118423Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The original tinyraytracer is written in C++.",
      "source_hash": 16668537696466965807,
      "context_hash": 13589862117856453939,
      "translation": "원본 tinyraytracer는 C++로 작성되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118423Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Since pulling the C++ runtime may be a bit too much for the tiniest cores, I ported it to plain C. my version is available [here](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/blob/master/FemtoRV/FIRMWARE/EXAMPLES/tinyraytracer.c).",
      "source_hash": 10967027924780886746,
      "context_hash": 16716844230908414767,
      "translation": "C++ 런타임을 끌어오는 것은 가장 작은 코어들에게는 다소 과할 수 있으므로, 저는 이를 순수 C로 포팅했습니다. 제 버전은 [여기](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/blob/master/FemtoRV/FIRMWARE/EXAMPLES/tinyraytracer.c)에서 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118423Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "If you want to use it for your own core, you will need to change three things:",
      "source_hash": 11888152738314864602,
      "context_hash": 1947780344373168307,
      "translation": "여러분 자신의 코어에 이것을 사용하고자 한다면, 세 가지를 변경해야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118423Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Function",
      "source_hash": 12017511910326844596,
      "context_hash": 2870157195455342292,
      "translation": "함수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118424Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Description",
      "source_hash": 1758583599421982602,
      "context_hash": 6360180304049344328,
      "translation": "설명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118424Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`graphics_width`",
      "source_hash": 16815934325651357143,
      "context_hash": 17188793102288973067,
      "translation": "`graphics_width`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118424Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "a macro that gives the screen width in pixels",
      "source_hash": 15724829158587987507,
      "context_hash": 1671849407992793738,
      "translation": "화면 너비를 픽셀 단위로 제공하는 매크로입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118424Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "`graphics_height`",
      "source_hash": 5987403983367048904,
      "context_hash": 11510301265438437919,
      "translation": "`graphics_height`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "a macro that gives the screen height in pixels",
      "source_hash": 13917002718964028727,
      "context_hash": 5959498971465446689,
      "translation": "화면 높이를 픽셀 단위로 제공하는 매크로입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "`graphics_init()`",
      "source_hash": 26317723416589531,
      "context_hash": 18403070056523243860,
      "translation": "`graphics_init()`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "a function that start graphic mode",
      "source_hash": 4151621930363261974,
      "context_hash": 9848106549150410677,
      "translation": "그래픽 모드를 시작하는 함수입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "`graphics_set_pixel(x,y,r,g,b)`",
      "source_hash": 4531111862391114488,
      "context_hash": 10535414057679917267,
      "translation": "`graphics_set_pixel(x,y,r,g,b)`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "x,y are ints, r,g,b are floats between 0.0 and 1.0",
      "source_hash": 6061568251234399757,
      "context_hash": 4913875857820040149,
      "translation": "x, y는 정수이고, r, g, b는 0.0에서 1.0 사이의 실수(float)입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "`graphics_terminate()`",
      "source_hash": 6861656365136658363,
      "context_hash": 2351853207739769465,
      "translation": "`graphics_terminate()`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "called at the end.",
      "source_hash": 2809098355480901907,
      "context_hash": 15762897745149532803,
      "translation": "마지막에 호출됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:18/seg:1",
      "source": "Leave empty if not needed.",
      "source_hash": 5367705120372636776,
      "context_hash": 7470483362723239388,
      "translation": "필요하지 않다면 비워 두십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "In addition, if your core has a tick counter, to display the elapsed time, you may define the following functions (leave their bodies empty if you do not need them)",
      "source_hash": 10987418269201489520,
      "context_hash": 15655893636244815553,
      "translation": "추가로, 여러분의 코어에 틱 카운터가 있다면, 경과 시간을 표시하기 위해 다음 함수들을 정의할 수 있습니다 (필요하지 않다면 본문을 비워 두십시오)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "Function",
      "source_hash": 12017511910326844596,
      "context_hash": 5446871240237130734,
      "translation": "함수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "`stats_begin_frame()`",
      "source_hash": 14150545072928665405,
      "context_hash": 11055277052056622786,
      "translation": "`stats_begin_frame()`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:22/seg:0",
      "source": "`stats_begin_pixel()`",
      "source_hash": 6729877395569650954,
      "context_hash": 388133925658230071,
      "translation": "`stats_begin_pixel()`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118425Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:23/seg:0",
      "source": "`stats_end_pixel()`",
      "source_hash": 14416692444761828947,
      "context_hash": 7211309818680069443,
      "translation": "`stats_end_pixel()`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118426Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:24/seg:0",
      "source": "`stats_end_frame()`",
      "source_hash": 16096708349969770714,
      "context_hash": 5596362198266321191,
      "translation": "`stats_end_frame()`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:57.118426Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:25/seg:0",
      "source": "These functions are meant to collect timings.",
      "source_hash": 15711207603797020346,
      "context_hash": 5309160507486960212,
      "translation": "이 함수들은 타이밍을 수집하기 위한 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.420656Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:25/seg:1",
      "source": "You can leave them empty if you do not need them.",
      "source_hash": 16907041142697618012,
      "context_hash": 10179855001298911938,
      "translation": "필요하지 않다면 비워 두어도 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.420657Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:25/seg:2",
      "source": "Timings are collected pixel by pixel, because on some small cores (femtorv32-quark), the clock tick counter is smaller (24 bits), and wraps during rendering of a frame.",
      "source_hash": 2694327494430077899,
      "context_hash": 9047366543856979018,
      "translation": "타이밍은 픽셀 단위로 수집되는데, 일부 소형 코어(femtorv32-quark)에서는 클록 틱 카운터가 더 작아서(24비트) 프레임 렌더링 중에 값이 순환하기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.420657Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Compiling",
      "source_hash": 8381158127317046945,
      "context_hash": 4925426848475475001,
      "translation": "컴파일하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.420658Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [this tutorial](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/blob/master/FemtoRV/TUTORIALS/software.md) for more information on how to compile RISC-V software for your own core.",
      "source_hash": 6959067145412687222,
      "context_hash": 14474554458972403145,
      "translation": "자신만의 코어용 RISC-V 소프트웨어를 컴파일하는 방법에 대한 더 많은 정보는 [이 튜토리얼](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/blob/master/FemtoRV/TUTORIALS/software.md)을 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.420658Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}